# Cricket Metrics — Backend environment example
# Copy to .env for local dev. On Railway, set these in the project Variables.

# Optional: Path to a single pipeline output directory (legacy single-format mode).
# If unset, the app looks for output_t20i/ and output_ipl/ relative to project root or DATA_ROOT.
# OUTPUT_DIR=/path/to/output

# Optional: Root directory for pipeline data. output_t20i/ and output_ipl/ are resolved under this path.
# Use in Docker/Railway when data is mounted at a different path.
# DATA_ROOT=/data

# Optional: Comma-separated list of allowed CORS origins (e.g. your Vercel frontend URL).
# Example: https://your-app.vercel.app,https://your-custom-domain.com
# CORS_ORIGINS=
